  "prefLabel": "Ins 801.09 Edit and Control Procedures for Statistical Agents",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 801.09 Edit and Control Procedures for Statistical Agents. Statistical agents shall adopt, edit, and control procedures to screen and check data for reasonableness, apparent accuracy, and completeness. These procedures shall, at a minimum, conform to the specifications provided in the NAIC Statistical Handbook, edition date 2012, as available in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #9053, eff 1-2-08; ss by #11008, eff 12-31-15; ss by #14505, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins800.html"
}
